        "text": "The recorder module can record and playback audio. It can also save and load WAV files. The audio input can come from a microphone or from some arbitrary patch in Syntona.\n\nTo Do:\n* Make sure your mic or instrument is connected and the VU meter is moving.\n* Click the \"record\" button and record a few seconds of audio.\n* Click \"play\" to stop recording and playback what you recorded.\n* Click on the 3 dot menu and select \"Save to WAV File...\".\n* Click on the 3 dot menu and select \"Load from WAV File...\". Load what you created or load some other file.\n* Hit \"play\" again.",
